sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as Native client
  participant Browser as Person's browser
  participant Auth as Docket authorization server
  participant API as Docket REST API
  Client->>Auth: discover resource and register client
  Client->>Browser: open PKCE authorization request
  Browser->>Auth: sign in and approve scope
  Auth->>Client: redirect with code and state
  Client->>Auth: exchange code with verifier
  Auth->>Client: issue access token
  Client->>API: call GET /v1/orgs
